<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South American</p>
<p>Libertadores Cup matches played Tuesday:</p>
<p>Second round, first leg</p>
<p>In Santiago: Universidad Catolica (Chile) 4 Oriente</p>
<p>Petrolero (Bolivia) 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Alberto Acosta 11, 70, 78, 88</p>
<p>Second round, second leg</p>
<p>In Porto Alegre, Brazil: Gremio (Brazil) 2 Guarany</p>
<p>(Paraguay) 1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Gremio - Paulo Nunes 64, Rodrigo Gral 86</p>
<p>Guarany - Hugo Oceval 85</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>Aggregate score: 3-3. Gremio win 2-1 on penalties.</p>
<p>In Montevideo: Penarol (Uruguay) 3 Millonarios (Colombia) 1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Penarol - Antonio Pacheco 21, Carlos Aguilera 40, Luis</p>
<p>Romero 67</p>
<p>Millonarios - Ricardo Perez 80, penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
<p>Aggregate score: 3-3. Penarol win 3-2 on penalties.</p>
</text>
